This pack is a draft: it is neither tested with the other community packs nor published until this file is removed.

Why: three abilities need engine support that the game does not have yet (see abilities/index.ts and the README):
- 01a Web-Sling: a response to the end-of-player-phase ready step that counts the upgrades it readied.
- 02 Enhanced Combat Sense: exhaust Weapon/Tech upgrades as [wild] resources while paying for this card, and count them.
- 06 With Great Firepower: a [wild] resource usable only for an upgrade ability's cost.
Every other ability is scripted; with those three stubbed, `mc-pack test` plays 6/6 games without an engine error.
